@deepseek-ai/dsh-model-catalog-bigmodel README · Known Limitations and Deferred Work：- Refresh runs on mount and when the managed credential named by `BIGMODEL_API_KEY` changes. Failure keeps the maintained catalog and logs the error.
- The Coding Plan Models endpoint has since started listing `glm-5.3`, which the 2026-09-09 verification confirmed. The id stays an explicit verified exception so a route whose endpoint drops it again keeps serving the model that a direct call proved.
- The endpoint supplies ids, not complete capability metadata. Context and output capacities therefore come from the reviewed descriptor table and remain pinned by package tests.
